{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-06-15 16:15:00', 'title': 'LIQAL EXPANDS LNG FUELING NETWORK IN GERMANY IN PARTNERSHIP WITH PITPOINT.LNG B.V.', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , JUNE 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ – LIQAL, PART OF DOVER FUELING SOLUTIONS ("DFS")\xa0AND DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV), RECENTLY ANNOUNCED THAT IT IS EXPANDING ITS LIQUEFIED NATURAL GAS (LNG) FUELING STATION NETWORK IN THE GERMAN MARKET, AS PART OF AN ONGOING PARTNERSHIP WITH PITPOINT.LNG B.V.'}